    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0294" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg220"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/627</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-06T18:00:00+03:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 6, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 7, 11.25
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1954. Minister of War granted nominally indefinite leave, really removed and
                    reported gone to monastery for recuperating. Bolsheviks reported preparing
                    demonstration across the river where many factories located. Immediate cause is
                    suppression of several Bolshevik papers including
                        Gorky’s.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d195-f1"/> Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs thinks Government can suppress but no one can foretell result
                    now.</p>
                <p>
                    Kerensky just spoken in Council of
                    Republic and demanded to know whether council will support the Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d195-f1" n="1" xml:id="d195-f1-content">
                <p>
                    Maxim Gorky’s <hi rendition="#italic">New Life.</hi>
                </p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
